le_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4a57058c3ecd66578b047923f3a8af7eb85f6e2", "message": "test: 3567 solution\n\npy", "created_at": "2026-03-20T00:22:35Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e2e928dafa12a295e9c3f9e76f4da79ca85bb19e", "message": "test: 3212 solution\n\npy", "created_at": "2026-03-18T22:13:33Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab801dd5ddfe7376277c3fcc4c714497ef70bcb8", "message": "test: 3070 solution\n\npy", "created_at": "2026-03-17T23:24:49Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "432b1ab360b12aad815fe382b24441381b026aa0", "message": "test: 1622 solution\n\npy", "created_at": "2026-03-14T23:32:03Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e0dcda1648ec5628af2b664d5bdce198910395a0", "message": "Merge pull request #180 from QuBenhao/fix/cookie-expiry-check\n\nfix: improve cookie expiry check by parsing JWT payload", "created_at": "2026-03-14T14:38:34Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f4c59612312dac3912c79916bcd493d69854a525", "message": "fix: improve cookie expiry check by parsing JWT payload\n\nThe previous implementation checked timestamps from third-party cookies\n(Cloudflare, Baidu Analytics, Google Analytics) which don't represent\nthe actual LeetCode login state.\n\nNow properly parses the LEETCODE_SESSION JWT to check the expired_time_\nfield for accurate expiry detection.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-14T14:33:41Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f8431724b2a4ef09f99975f8be5bc8438e0d3636", "message": "Merge pull request #179 from QuBenhao/refactor/improve-code-quality\n\nrefactor: improve code quality", "created_at": "2026-03-14T11:17:07Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b04a4abcfb3151313098bf82b8103cdd6925937e", "message": "fix: address code review issues from PR #179\n\n- Remove unsafe eval() fallback in safe_literal_eval to prevent code injection\n- Use contextvars for i18n language state to fix race condition in concurrent environments\n- Replace broad Exception catches with specific exception types in browser_cookie.py\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-14T11:08:40Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1e1f13cbddcce24c37a8ab4a0efe00de2cf81832", "message": "fix: update problem query", "created_at": "2026-03-14T10:55:20Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e306f2c4df5a2bbc9373f10cc683225d09b07119", "message": "refactor: modularize leetcode.py main entry\n\n- Refactor leetcode.py to use new CLI modules\n- Remove inline I18N dictionary (use cli.i18n module)\n- Remove inline helper functions (use cli.input_utils module)\n- Remove inline cookie functions (use cli.browser_cookie module)\n- Add section comments for better code organization\n- Extract helper functions for category and contest handling\n- Fix import path in tools.py (daily_auto import)\n\nThe refactored leetcode.py is ~40% smaller while maintaining\nall original functionality.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-14T10:33:08Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f8bf512a7f7dac779c53e1565ebdb6cbce77e4f", "message": "refactor: improve code quality and safety\n\n- Replace unsafe eval() with ast.literal_eval() in question.py\n- Add safe_literal_eval() function with fallback for edge cases\n- Improve exception handling with specific exception types\n- Add comprehensive type annotations to submission.py functions\n- Implement exponential backoff retry strategy for submissions\n- Extract CLI module with i18n, input utils, and cookie management\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "created_at": "2026-03-14T10:11:34Z", "repo": "LeetCode", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}], "prs": [{"created_at": "2019-10-14T06:18:44Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2019-10-13T16:10:53Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2020-05-14T06:01:46Z", "body_length": 13}, {"created_at": "2026-03-14T14:34:21Z", "body_length": 545}, {"created_at": "2026-03-14T10:59:09Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2026-03-14T02:56:42Z", "body_length": 1149}, {"created_at": "2026-03-13T00:50:42Z", "body_length": 730}, {"created_at": "2026-02-22T08:01:45Z", "body_length": 25}, {"created_at": "2026-01-24T00:03:36Z", "body_length": 17}, {"created_at": "2026-01-10T13:00:21Z", "body_length": 42}, {"created_at": "2025-09-15T00:03:51Z", "body_length": 34}, {"created_at": "2025-09-11T23:38:36Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-08-30T02:05:23Z", "body_length": 1691}, {"created_at": "2025-07-04T00:19:21Z", "body_length": 31}, {"created_at": "2025-06-24T14:48:18Z", "body_length": 62}, {"created_at": "2025-06-12T12:39:07Z", "body_length": 109}, {"created_at": "2025-06-11T07:11:27Z", "body_length": 127}, {"created_at": "2025-06-10T06:49:38Z", "body_length": 39}, {"created_at": "2025-06-08T12:53:38Z", "body_length": 550}, {"created_at": "2025-05-21T07:40:40Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-05-21T06:10:40Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-05-19T03:14:10Z", "body_length": 0}, {"created_at": "2025-04-26T08:05:23Z", "body_length": 55}, {"created_at": "2025-04-24T14:38:19Z", "body_length": 116}, {"created_at": "2025-04-22T13:43:36Z", "body_length": 64}, {"created_at": "2024-09-24T14:25:19Z", "body_length": 36}, {"created_at": "2024-09-13T13:49:22Z", "body